  "description": "Replacement of existing damaged timber windows and door to the rear elevation of Flats 37A and 37B, 37 Nevern Hall Gardens, as part of remedial works following subsidence.\n\nThe proposed replacements will be manufactured in timber to closely replicate the existing windows and door in terms of design, proportions, glazing configuration and external appearance, incorporating double glazing to improve thermal performance and meet applicable Building Regulations requirements.\n\nAll works will be undertaken within the existing structural openings, with no alterations to the building's footprint or existing residential use.",
